 "remarks": "Resort living at its finest in this highly desirable gated association offering vacation-like amenities! This sun-filled contemporary end-unit townhouse opens to a foyer that leads into a large living room showcasing a 2-story soaring ceiling and double-sided gas fireplace for gatherings. The family room flows off the living room & has a large wall of glass sliders leading to an expansive stone patio. You'll love meal time in your chef's kitchen with upscale appliances: 5-burner Viking gas stove, Miele dishwasher & double-oven wall unit making entertainnigt! An abundance of white cabinets, multiple prep areas, stainless steel refrigerator , additional built-in wine cooler makes entertaining easy. There's also a breakfast bar for quick meals or enjoy dining fireside for warmth & ambiance. For al fresco coffee, enjoy the separate private front patio accessed off the kitchen slider. Retire to either of 2 bedrooms on the main level w/updated baths & custom closets. The primary bedroom features a vaulted ceiling w/an overhead fan, walk-in closet, slider to outdoor patio, hall laundry & beautiful updated bathroom w/heated floors, double sinks, stone counter tops & tub shower. The 2nd sunny bedroom is served by its own updated hall bath. For additional living space options, venture upstairs to an open loft/media/office/gym area w/its own closet overlooking the dramatic living room below. The walk-in attic on this floor offers seamless access for extra storage. Pool,Tennis,Picklebal",
